{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q199RKKHXyxFuizX8SwwL6","type":"tool_result","content":"total 284\ndrwxrws---  16 summereunann datausers     24 Oct 31 02:23 .\ndrwxrwsrwx 127 summereunann datausers    139 Oct 30 20:58 ..\ndrwxrws---   2 summereunann datausers      2 Oct 30 20:58 artifacts\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 30 20:58 .claude\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 30 20:58 .codex\ndrwxrws---   4 summereunann datausers      4 Oct 30 21:01 datasets\ndrwxrws---   2 summereunann datausers      8 Oct 30 23:37 figures\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 30 20:58 .gemini\n-rw-rw-rw-   1 summereunann datausers   3410 Jul 30 17:02 .gitignore\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers   1493 Oct 30 21:18 literature_review.md\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers     18 Oct 31 02:23 logs\ndrwxrws---   2 summereunann datausers      4 Oct 31 02:23 .neurico\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      7 Oct 31 02:23 paper_draft\ndrwxrwx---   2 summereunann datausers      3 Jul 28 20:17 paper_examples\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers   7141 Oct 31 02:22 planning.md\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers    463 Oct 30 20:59 pyproject.toml\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers   2626 Oct 31 02:22 README.md\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers  27091 Oct 31 02:23 REPORT.md\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers    643 Oct 30 21:18 resources.md\ndrwxrws---   5 summereunann datausers     29 Oct 31 02:22 results\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers     17 Oct 31 02:22 src\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 31 02:23 templates\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers 175418 Oct 30 20:59 uv.lock\ndrwxrws---   5 summereunann datausers     10 Oct 30 21:00 .venv\npaper_draft/neurips_2025.pdf\npaper_draft/neurips_2025.sty\npaper_draft/neurips_2025.tex\npaper_draft/style_config.yaml\n\n.claude/skills/paper-writer:\nassets\nreferences\nSKILL.md\n\nfigures:\nfig1_rank.png\nfig2_heads.png\nfig3_entropy.png\nfig4_prune.png\nfig5_mi.png\nfig6_depth.png\n\npaper_draft:\ncommands\nneurips_2025.pdf\nneurips_2025.sty\nneurips_2025.tex\nstyle_config.yaml\n\npaper_draft/commands:\ngeneral.tex\nmacros.tex\nmath.tex\n\npaper_examples:\nREADME.md\n\nresults:\naccuracy.csv\naudit.txt\nh1.csv\nh1_summary.csv\nh2.csv\nh2_summary.csv\nh3.csv\nh3_entropy_importance_corr.csv\nh3_finetune.csv\nh3_finetune_summary.csv\nh3_summary.csv\nh3_sweep.csv\nh4_cells.csv\nh4_excess.csv\nh4_implied_C.csv\nh4_init.csv\nh4_long.csv\nh4_regression.csv\nh4_trajectory.csv\nh4_var_bound.csv\nh5.csv\nh5_ratios.csv\nh5_summary.csv\nmi\nrepro_check.txt\nruns\nruns_repro\n\ntemplates/paper_writing:\nlab_style_guide.md\nstyle_examples.md\n---\nname: neurico-paper-writer-pitfalls\ndescription: \"NeuriCo paper-writing runs: neurips_2025 [final] and general.tex compile traps, and REPORT.md references/counts need checking\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: acab57a5-067a-4a1b-b5bb-257976113aa0\n  modified: 2026-10-31T06:20:31.127Z\n---\n\nTraps in the NeuriCo paper-writing stage (seen 2026-10-30, embedding_collapse_repetition run):\n- `\\usepackage[final]{neurips_2025}` sets no track, so `\\@trackname` is undefined at `\\maketitle`. Keep the mandated line and add `\\makeatletter\\providecommand{\\@trackname}{}\\makeatother` after it.\n- `commands/general.tex` renews `\\algorithmicindent`, so load `algpseudocode` before `\\input{commands/general}`.\n- `paper_examples/` may hold only a README; style then comes from `templates/paper_writing/`.\n- REPORT.md references \"from memory\" can be wrong (venues, years, author names), and summary counts can count ties or significance as strict wins. Check citations online and recompute counts from `results/*.csv`.\n- Also seen 2026-10-31 (fp_error_propagation run): REPORT.md summary ranges can be off in small ways, and a blanket claim (\"largest source\") can hide one exception or quote one format's correlation. Recompute from `results/`, including `*.partial_*.jsonl`, which may hold arms missing from the final jsonl. Report author lists can't be taken from two-column pdftotext order; use the arXiv page.\n- `/tmp/<fixed-name>` may be unwritable on this host; pipe scripts through `python - <<'E'` or use `mktemp -d`.\n\n**Why:** each cost a debugging step, and the wrong citations would have reached the paper.\n**How to apply:** do these checks before drafting. See also [[neurico-host-local-llm-fallback]].\n\nAlso seen 2026-10-31 (sgd_escape_time run): capped/censored medians can leak into ratio statistics even when the report says they are excluded. A ratio of two capped values is just the ratio of the caps (values like exactly 0.5 or 2.0, or a mean equal to cap×η, give it away), so recompute on fully observed units and check which subset a quoted median covers. Also `\\figleft`/`\\figright` need `{}` before text, and `\\appref` is not defined in math.tex.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f42d925-3fb0-401c-b4de-561355f745c0","uuid":"aa5ab3e5-ae59-4b23-af6d-be4c27880d4e","timestamp":"2026-10-31T07:23:21.934Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 284\ndrwxrws---  16 summereunann datausers     24 Oct 31 02:23 .\ndrwxrwsrwx 127 summereunann datausers    139 Oct 30 20:58 ..\ndrwxrws---   2 summereunann datausers      2 Oct 30 20:58 artifacts\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 30 20:58 .claude\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 30 20:58 .codex\ndrwxrws---   4 summereunann datausers      4 Oct 30 21:01 datasets\ndrwxrws---   2 summereunann datausers      8 Oct 30 23:37 figures\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers      3 Oct 30 20:58 .gemini\n-rw-rw-rw-   1 summereunann datausers   3410 Jul 30 17:02 .gitignore\n-rw-rw----   1 summereunann datausers   1493 Oct 30 21:18 literature_review.md\ndrwxrws---   3 summereunann datausers     18 Oct 31 02:23 logs\ndrwxrws---   2 summereunann datausers      4 Oct 31 02:23 .neurico\ndrwxrws-